# Vulnerabilities accepted after review, one ID per line with a reason and an expiry, e.g.
# CVE-2099-0001  # in a jar Spark ships, not reachable from our jobs; recheck 2027-01-01

# Netty SNI routing bypass (netty-handler 4.2.7, bundled with Spark 4.1.3). Only affects
# servers that route TLS by SNI; Spark's RPC/shuffle doesn't use SniHandler and we run no
# TLS servers on Netty. Drop when Spark ships Netty >= 4.2.17. Recheck 2027-01-31.
CVE-2026-75595
